{
  "title": { "zh": "边的强弱和朝向", "en": "Edge strength and direction" },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "一条斜着的边，在横、竖两张变化图里各只出现一半。",
        "en": "A slanted edge shows up only half in each of the two change maps."
      }
    }
  ],
  "after": {
    "zh": "横、竖两个变化合成一个箭头：<wiki-ref to=\"gradient\"></wiki-ref>。长度是边有多陡，方向指向变亮最快的一边，和边垂直。",
    "en": "The two changes make one arrow: the <wiki-ref to=\"gradient\"></wiki-ref>. Its length is how steep the edge is; it points the way brightness rises fastest, across the edge."
  },
  "tray": "main",
